# Never commit Elegant Themes code or caches. They live outside the repo
# (PP_CACHE_DIR, default ~/.cache/divi-page-builder); these guard against accidental local copies.
# Same rules as Skill/divi-page-builder/scripts/preview/.gitignore, plus the R5 spike's artefacts:
# rendered HTML and screenshots embed Divi's licensed CSS/JS/fonts.
*.zip
Divi/
Divi-*/
cache/
sites/
wordpress/
et-cache/
out/
shots/
pages/
*.html
*.png
*-geo.json
__pycache__/
